取得でき次第、ここに自動で表示されます。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,78.0 9.1,81.9 14.2,83.8 19.3,78.0 24.5,76.1 29.6,85.7 34.7,83.8 39.8,83.8 44.9,85.7 50.0,87.6 55.1,85.7 60.3,83.8 65.4,76.1 70.5,64.6 75.6,64.6 80.7,53.1 85.8,58.8 91.0,55.0 96.1,39.6 101.2,43.5 106.3,45.4 111.4,45.4 116.5,72.3 121.6,62.7 126.8,68.4 131.9,97.2 137.0,85.7 142.1,85.7 147.2,66.5 152.3,64.6 157.4,64.6 162.6,62.7 167.7,58.8 172.8,72.3 177.9,74.2 183.0,78.0 188.1,80.0 193.2,78.0 198.4,85.7 203.5,78.0 208.6,62.7 213.7,55.0 218.8,62.7 223.9,60.8 229.0,43.5 234.2,47.3 239.3,20.4 244.4,14.7 249.5,12.8 254.6,43.5 259.7,35.8 264.9,35.8 270.0,32.0 275.1,30.0 280.2,24.3 285.3,24.3 290.4,12.8 295.5,22.4 300.7,20.4 305.8,24.3 310.9,28.1 316.0,30.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"30.0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,40.9 6.1,44.3 8.3,45.4 10.4,46.6 12.5,58.9 14.7,48.8 16.8,51.1 19.0,55.6 21.1,56.7 23.2,53.3 25.4,55.6 27.5,45.4 29.6,43.2 31.8,38.7 33.9,42.0 36.1,37.5 38.2,55.6 40.3,52